  "description": "This library provides types for various standardized submodels, simplifying the creation of submodel instances with first-level language support. It abstracts the complexities of the meta model, facilitating the creation of accurate submodel instances. Additional features include validation rules derived from submodel templates and conversion logic for transforming submodels to and from the original AAS metamodel representations.",
